请对以下 case 进行三维加权评分。

=== case_id ===
Case-19-photo-album-001

=== 用户原始指令 (query.txt) ===
相册整个图,带数字显示,点一下跳应用,提醒快不行了

=== TaskSpec 契约 (task.taskSpec.json) ===
{
  "userQuery": "相册整个图,带数字显示,点一下跳应用,提醒快不行了",
  "size": "2x2",
  "eventCandidates": [
    {
      "call": "clickToDeeplink",
      "args": {
        "bundleName": "com.huawei.hmos.settings",
        "abilityName": "com.huawei.hmos.settings.MainAbility",
        "uri": "storage_settings"
      }
    }
  ],
  "dataModelSchema": {
    "album": {
      "countText": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "相册照片数量的短展示文本",
        "sampleValue": "128张"
      },
      "statusText": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "相册容量或可用状态的警告提示",
        "sampleValue": "相册快满了"
      }
    }
  },
  "assetCandidates": [
    {
      "src": "resources/base/media/externaldrive_fill.svg",
      "description": "本地存储管理实心图标，适合表达相册占用空间、存储容量和文件管理入口。"
    }
  ]
}

=== 待评审 DSL (card.dsl.jsonl，共 3 行) ===
